  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You've given your techniques fancy names, a habit that tends to get laughed at until their efficacy is well-documented. It will be soon enough.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Assassin techniques class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose one of your specializations. The Difficulty Class of all saving throws called for by techniques of that specialization increases by +1.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Specialization Focus multiple times. Each time, choose another one of your specializations.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/assassin-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
